WEBVTT

00:11:59.737 --> 00:12:05.946
Closing the gap has become 
a passion for me,

00:12:05.946 --> 00:12:08.547
and I'm doing this 
through programs

00:12:08.547 --> 00:12:11.689
like Darwin on Rounds at UCLA,

00:12:11.689 --> 00:12:17.236
where we're bringing animal experts 
and evolutionary biologists

00:12:17.236 --> 00:12:21.388
and embedding them
on our medical teams

00:12:21.388 --> 00:12:25.326
with our interns and our residents.

00:12:25.326 --> 00:12:29.033
And through Zoobiquity conferences,

00:12:29.033 --> 00:12:33.252
where we bring medical schools 
together with veterinary schools